% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% kernel.clausal -- the SHARED FLOOR for sg/payments/psa_licence_class (classification family).
% DAG root of the determination-slices layout. It holds ONLY the
% PREDICATES that two or more files CALL -- possibly none, which is why
% the export list below starts empty.
%
% Result term (built by the single determination slice psa_licence_class):
%   psa_licence(LICENCE, MPI_TRIGGERS, VOLUME_TOTAL_CENTS, CITATIONS)
%
%   LICENCE:
%     no_licence_required
%     | exempt_payment_service_provider
%     | money_changing_licence
%     | standard_payment_institution_licence
%     | major_payment_institution_licence
%     | indeterminate
%
%   MPI_TRIGGERS: a list (subset, fixed order) drawn from
%     [single_service_volume, multi_service_volume, e_money_account_float, e_money_issued]
%     (empty unless LICENCE is major_payment_institution_licence)
%
%   VOLUME_TOTAL_CENTS: integer sum of the calendar-year average monthly
%     volumes of the volume-tested services the person provides
%     (0 when none; n_a only when LICENCE is indeterminate)
%
%   CITATIONS: a list of bare citation atoms (e.g. sg_psa_2019_s6_4),
%     in the order the rules state them.
%
% Source: Payment Services Act 2019 (Singapore), s 5(1), s 6(2)-(5),
%         s 6(17), First Schedule Part 1.
% =====================================================================

:- module(kernel, []).

:- end_module(kernel).
